        30 \u0441\u0435\u043A\u0443\u043D\u0434"
      _descriptionEn: Increases speed by 15 percent for a duration of 30 seconds
      _descriptionTr: "H\u0131z\u0131 30 saniye boyunca y\xFCzde 15 oran\u0131nda
        art\u0131r\u0131r"
      _kind: 0
      _slot: 0
      _rarity: 0
      _isSold: 1
      _bonusType: 0
